  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/databricks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure Databricks</u></a> now supports <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/key-vault/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure Key Vault</u></a> backed secret scope. With this, Azure Databricks now supports two types of secret scopes&mdash;Azure Key Vault-backed and Databricks-backed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about&nbsp;<a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.azuredatabricks.net%2Fuser-guide%2Fsecrets%2Fsecret-scopes.html%23akv-ss&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cdemengha%40microsoft.com%7C7276d4cbfcea410ddc2c08d61928c873%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636724060289635383&amp;sdata=8wY2a1CRzFsNYjKGqFC2H3MF2qjW8mRk9GZN%2BQDvT5M%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Azure Key Vault-backed secret scope</u></a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Databricks now supports Azure Key Vault backed secret scope. With this, Azure Databricks now supports two types of secret scopes—Azure Key Vault-backed and Databricks-backed.\n\nLearn more about Azure Key Vault-backed secret scope ."
  },
